        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Patient and daughter report diagnosis approximately 6 months ago at a sports clinic; no supporting letters in Best Practice or My Health Record. Clinician assesses a typical exertional pattern, currently quiescent, with no red flags or acute compartment syndrome."
