        },
        "valueString": "Left shin/calf pressure pain and tightness, described as 'like going to explode', after approximately 20–30 minutes of fast walking, heavy work, or stairs. Settles after approximately 15 minutes with rest and leg elevation. History obtained from patient and daughter."
